          <h2 style={{ fontFamily: "'Playfair Display', serif", fontSize: "clamp(18px,4vw,34px)", fontWeight: 400, color: C.gold, marginBottom: 24 }}>Build Smart Careers. Stay Safe from Scams.</h2>
          <p style={{ color: C.muted, fontSize: 15, maxWidth: 500, margin: "0 auto 38px", lineHeight: 1.85 }}>The only career platform with a built-in AI boss who analyzes your resume, detects scams, roasts your CV, and preps you for interviews.</p>
          <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: 14, justifyContent: "center", flexWrap: "wrap" }}>
